                            <comment id="17119068" author="ptupitsyn" created="Thu, 28 May 2020 20:47:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kukushal&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kukushal&quot;&gt;kukushal&lt;/a&gt; keepBinary mode requires the same treatment - service may take BinaryObject[], so array conversion is necessary. I&apos;ve added tests for both .NET-&amp;gt;.NET and .NET-&amp;gt;Java calls to demonstrate this.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
